`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["Claude remembers things from your conversations on its own, and that memory applies in Cowork tasks too. The context that reliably carries from task to task, though, is the context you set up deliberately: ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"global instructions"}),", which apply to every Cowork session, and ",(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"projects"}),", where Claude builds memory automatically from the conversations you have inside them. Most people start with global instructions and add projects as recurring work surfaces."]}),`
